              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bābīra amagufa yabo, bayahamba musi y’igiti c’umwesheli i Yabeshi nyene, baca barisonzesha kumara imisi ndwi.",
